WEBVTT

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.660
Another Path

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.080
Pum...

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.870
Our sacred dance has come undone!

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.130
To have made such short
work of almost all of us...

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.380
So <i>this </i>is the Kyou clan's sacred dance.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.390
No, not the Kyou clan's
dance--Kyou Kai's.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.520
I see now. All the clan elders
must have made quite a fuss.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.820
I know, Seki Kaku. <i>We </i>are the Shiyuu.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.530
It's all right, Ryo Kusui.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.280
I haven't fallen that deeply yet,

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.530
and I have plenty of breath left.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.240
My deep dance is for Yuu Ren.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.790
Yuu Ren!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.210
In one fell swoop--

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.000
She's moving even faster!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Ren!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.590
Wha--

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.180
She synced her dance to mine?!

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.350
Wow...

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:27.150
This woman...

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.030
She's <i>tough</i>.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:32.950
Kyou Shou must be spinning in her grave.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:39.120
Just think: You came to avenge her
and got yourself killed instead.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.580
Calm yourself. Your dance has left you,

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.040
but you still have more
than half your breath.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.880
This woman, though...

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.720
Did she see through my dance
while not dancing herself?

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.390
But that's just...

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:57.850
What now?

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.930
Fall into an even deeper dance?

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.640
Or fall back and watch for a while?

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:09.150
Out of everyone, Kai, your breathing--

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.910
Extremely quick and decisive
battles--that's how I fight.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:22.370
Pum... pum...

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.370
I'll finish this with a deeper dance.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.540
What's this... this chill in the air?

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.510
Kyou Kai...

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:44.310
Yes, Seki Kaku, I'm aware.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.850
Bring it on, Kyou Kai.
I shall teach you a lesson.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.690
Pum, pa-rum...

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.980
Pum...

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.570
Did you catch any of that?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.570
Not... much at all.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.960
B-But that's absurd...

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.720
My deepest dance, and it didn't work.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.430
Is she just that much stronger?

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.520
No.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:10.190
There's something <i>off </i>about this woman.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:13.520
I <i>thought </i>she wasn't dancing,

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.530
but at times there were signs
she was in a deep dance indeed.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:18.860
What on earth...

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:23.990
Did you think my underhanded
tricks meant I was weak?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:30.330
Or that your love for your
sister would fortify you?

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:35.880
Did you think your rage
would be your strength?

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:41.550
Did you think your childish beliefs
would work against the Shiyuu,

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.430
you rotten brat?

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.510
How dare you?!

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:50.600
The sacred dance sends one's spirit
toward the depths of one's heart

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:54.770
and draws out the power hidden within.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:58.690
Thus emotions--be they rage or love--

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:03.660
are nothing but chains, binding one's
consciousness to the outside!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.500
If this is indeed true
of the sacred dance,

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:14.080
severing our worldly ties
would only make things easier.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:19.090
We created something to do
just that--by force.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.260
Do you know what that is, little girl?

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.970
The Ritual?

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.890
Exactly right.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:32.890
I can now drop as deep as in
any sacred dance with no run-up--

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.900
because <i>I </i>have made it through the Ritual.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:44.820
You may be the greatest when
it comes to natural talents,

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.370
but you haven't undergone
the all-important Ritual.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:53.670
You missed out on becoMei
the real Shiyuu, you buffoon.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:57.000
Y-You may have made
it through the Ritual...

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:01.090
...but only because you
fought dirty against Shou!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.590
Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.800
The Ritual went on even
after I killed Kyou Shou.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.470
And I fought on, win after win,

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.850
until my final foe stood before me.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:15.230
She was the other
representative of my clan:

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:17.270
my younger sister--by blood.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.400
And then...

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:30.160
Therein lies the meaning behind
two being chosen from each clan.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.500
Just try to imagine it:

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:38.340
the sensation of piercing Kyou Shou's
heart in the Ritual--by your own hand!

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:50.100
More than enough justification for
becoMei a monster, don't you think?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.190
Of all who've made it through
the Ritual so far,

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:59.020
just how many were <i>real </i>Shiyuu?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.360
It was <i>flawless</i>.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:07.030
A perfect banquet of madness, Kyou Kai!

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:13.620
You will <i>never </i>reach my heights--

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:19.630
because Kyou Shou, your fodder,
isn't around anymore!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.000
Yuu Ren!

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.700
Now sleep.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.160
Kyou Kai!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.290
She blocked it?!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:59.830
Ryo Kusui, is it?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.960
Hey--we've got a rat.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.090
Huh?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.090
Tch.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:06.800
Isn't that--

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.880
Go on.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.510
B-But...

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:13.810
We're still out of breath from the dance--

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.060
<i>Go</i>.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.270
Of course.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.740
Sister...

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.530
Shou... I... will...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.240
Kyou Kai!

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.580
So she's finally dead.

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:45.380
I'm sorry, sister...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.960
My breath...

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.470
The strength to grip Ryo Kusui...

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.800
I... I was naïve.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.430
Yuu Ren...

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.810
She's a real-life monster.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:04.400
To transcend rage--and everything else--

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.610
and unleash an unlimited
strength from within...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.700
To obtain that power,

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.240
she laid hands on her own blood sister...

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.080
We are too different...

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.410
Far too different.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.330
I don't have what it takes

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.170
to go up against that...

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:33.260
I... I really am sorry... Shou.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.840
I'm about to...

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.810
Kyou Kai!

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.280
What is that?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.450
That... tiny little light?

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.450
Eh? What is it again...?

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.080
I'm... I'm forgetting something.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.590
But... what could it be?

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:10.340
"Hi"

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.550
Oh?

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:17.050
What gives? You still half-asleep?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.520
Now let's go kick some ass,

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:23.060
lieutenant of the Hi Shin Force:
Kyou Kai!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.150
Aha... so that's it...

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.240
What--

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.580
Kyou Kai!

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.420
<i>That's </i>what it's about.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:01.390
The girl still lives!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.730
So you survived.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:07.480
What can you do from there, little girl?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.900
I know what it is--

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.570
the secret of the dance.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:19.450
Yuu Ren... your reasoning
is correct, to be sure.

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.950
You're now a monster who
doesn't need the sacred dance.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:28.830
And yet... I saw, just now,
a pleading light...

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.920
...asking if that's truly the pinnacle.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:36.720
It feels like you're not at
the very height of strength

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:41.180
because there exists a polar
opposite strength that negates it.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.270
I remembered.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:50.020
Shou had noticed... long, long before.

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.770
What are you talking about, you fool?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.730
How about <i>this</i>, Yuu Ren?

00:11:55.740 --> 00:12:00.700
The technique Shou was
developing to kill <i>me</i>!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.330
Wha--

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.370
Kyou Shou--kill Kyou Kai?!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.460
Watch this, sister.

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.920
Watch what's likely...

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.090
...my final dance!

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.340
Shou!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.630
Shou!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:25.560
What happened, Elder?
I can't sense Shou at all!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.100
Shou is...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:32.400
It seems she's gone and
defied the Kin realm taboo.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.480
Kin realm taboo?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:38.700
There is a limit to the depths our
spirits may fall in the sacred dance;

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:43.450
we call that domain the Kin realm.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:48.830
While the dance's song is a hypnotic
to drive our minds downward,

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:52.170
it's also a signpost to pull
our minds back up.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:58.840
Pum, pa-rum... pum, pa-rum...

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:56.000
But sink too deep, beyond the Kin realm,

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.840
and you cannot hear the song
guiding you upward--

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.430
or find your way back.

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:04.300
So she'll never wake up?!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.720
No.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.850
A few have gone beyond the Kin realm,

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:14.730
and every one has died
without regaining consciousness.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.690
Th-That can't be...

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:22.030
The Kin realm is the spirit's
line between life and death.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:26.120
Even we cannot reach it by instinct.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.700
To think Shou entered
this forbidden realm--

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.500
a realm even you did not know about.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:36.630
Why would Shou go to such a place?

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.590
Because of <i>you</i>, Kai.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:43.470
She was risking her life
to find a technique

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:47.100
that could defeat you
in the upcoMei Ritual.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.360
Th-This girl...

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.400
Even if her breath <i>has </i>returned--

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:06.490
No--it hasn't. Her lungs are split open;
she's coughing up blood.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.620
But more than that,

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.540
the way she <i>moves</i>!

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.620
How deep must she have gone?

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:18.040
I know, Seki Kaku.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.920
If we go any further to match her,

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.800
our minds will be lost to the depths
of darkness, never to return.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:32.390
Kyou Kai, you... you're not
planning on coMei back...

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:38.020
You fool. You've gone too far.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.780
Go ahead and destroy yourself,
then, Kyou Kai.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.790
Shou!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.840
Eeyow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:02.880
What <i>is </i>all this?!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.050
Ow, ow, ow...

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:09.510
Um, multiple broken bones,
hairline fractures, pulled muscles...

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.220
But never mind that--you're back!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.640
Oh, Shou, thank goodness!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:19.190
Single-mindedly... yet
probably accidentally...

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:20.520
Huh?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:24.030
I was falling to a terrific depth...

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.360
...and couldn't hear anything anymore.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:32.120
I couldn't even sense my trusty Haku Hau.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:37.790
It was scary: pitch black,
with no idea which way was up.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.670
Before long, I even lost
the ability to think.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:48.590
And then, faintly...
a single point of light.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.760
I followed that light back here.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:56.180
I think that light was...

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.940
No--I <i>know </i>what it was:

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.650
it was <i>you</i>, Kai. Yes.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.860
Thanks, Kai.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.870
You brat.

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:14.490
Not coMei back, are you?

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.620
Kyou Kai!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.540
Darkness.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.420
Complete darkness.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:24.840
I can't even feel Ryo Kusui.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.220
I can see nothing.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.010
I can hear nothing.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.560
But...

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:36.640
This ray of light I feel at my back...

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.520
This is what makes us different, Yuu Ren.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.900
I can be at the depths of the Kin realm,

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.780
but as long as I have this light...

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.280
<i>I </i>can come back.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.910
Kai...

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.140
Ren!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.060
Ren!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.310
Are you... kidding me...?

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:22.600
You never even made
it through the Ritual--

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.860
there's no way... you could defeat <i>me</i>...

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.900
It was chance.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.200
By sheer happenstance,

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:38.660
I met a group of people who
anchor me to the outside world.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.710
Ri... ridiculous...

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:43.500
The Ritual is meant to sever those ties.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.710
Hence why I'm the Shiyuu.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.510
But then why am I...

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.510
That power... I won't stand for it.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:18:00.520
Nor your existence... you who would
deny the Ritual--the Shiyuu...

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.270
You watch, Kyou Kai...
one thing's for certain:

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:11.440
The <i>next </i>Shiyuu <i>will </i>come
to kill you--make no mistake!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.910
I hope she does.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.830
I will <i>not </i>lose.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.120
Little... girl...

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:28.840
Why, you--!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:34.420
Dammit!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.550
The old hag!

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.930
Don't underestimate me, you damn brats.

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:47.810
Mei? I have just one favor to ask.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:56.320
Kai!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.750
Hide Yuu Ren's corpse?

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.080
Yes. Please.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:11.670
That way it looks like I failed,
and Yuu Ren is still alive somewhere.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.090
To keep the next Ritual from taking place?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.970
Yes. If at all possible...

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.350
the Ritual should never happen again.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:29.730
We've made it this far--
we should be all right.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.690
Yuu Ren may have been a monster...

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:37.740
but you became quite the monster yourself.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:41.370
Still, don't use that technique again.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.620
Your body can't take it.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.080
Right.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.630
Yuu Ren...

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:56.590
You know, she might have been
suffering even more than I.

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:01.100
Ever since she laid
her hand on her sister.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.600
What deep ties they must have had--

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.690
deep enough to transform
her into the Shiyuu.

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:14.230
But that's a different matter
from what befell Kyou Shou.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.530
Of course.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.620
Sister... it's over at last.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.870
After five long years.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:31.710
Truthfully, I was planning
to end things here.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:35.170
I'd originally decided to die
in the Ritual--for you.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.090
After what happened that day,

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:43.390
I lived to avenge you.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:45.640
So I really did think

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.270
that I'd come be with you
right after I had my revenge.

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.230
That it was pointless to go on living.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.740
But now,

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.910
I can see another path before me.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.870
A completely different path.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.330
I'm sorry, Shou.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:18.050
I'm not leaving you here,
leaving you behind.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:21.840
I'll go on with the sensation
of you always by my side.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.260
Here in the outside world
you'd dreamed of,

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.970
I'll live life to the fullest--

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:31.440
enough for the both of us.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:35.860
Please, Shou. Watch over me.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.150
Kai?

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:42.490
Mei...

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:47.240
Could you at least tell the village
elder that I avenged Shou?

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.330
You won't tell her yourself?

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.170
I'm not going back there.

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.250
Why not?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.590
My home...

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.710
is somewhere else now.

00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:40.270
Wh-Whoa! Hey, gang! This is <i>huge</i>!

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:43.440
Everybody get out here! Hurry!

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:46.910
C'mon, make it snappy!
This is a big deal!

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:46.910
What? Sheesh, keep it down!

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:49.620
What could it be at such an early hour?

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.490
Just <i>look</i>, wouldja?!

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:54.410
That's...

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:56.710
It's Kyou Kai!

00:23:56.710 --> 00:23:58.920
Kyou Kai... it's you!

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:07.550
Kyou... Kyou...

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:10.140
I'm home.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.640
--Kyou Kai!
--It's Kyou Kai!

00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:14.560
Lieutenant Kyou Kai!

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:16.140
So that's their amazingly talented
woman lieutenant, eh?

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:16.140
Welcome back!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:17.390
We missed you!

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:18.350
Kyou Kai.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:26.650
Is it finished?

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:27.650
Yeah.

00:24:28.530 --> 00:24:29.570
Huh.

00:24:31.070 --> 00:24:34.330
So you can finally move forward with us.

00:24:37.620 --> 00:24:38.750
Yeah.

00:24:43.040 --> 00:24:45.960
Welcome back, Kyou Kai.
We've been waitin' for you.

00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:48.720
--Hooray!
--Welcome back!

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:52.350
Glad to have you!
